{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-year-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.65, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-year`: `scale-county-timeagg-month`'s months (January, April, July and October 2020), day types, hours and source types with `<aggregateBy key=\"Year\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`, over the same county database (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`), and with crankcase running and extended idle, brake and tire wear PM10 and PM2.5, and running Total Energy and Atmospheric CO2 beside THC, CO and NOx at running, start, crankcase start, extended idle and APU. MOVESOutput is 18,071 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is PreAggYEAR.sql on top of PreAggDAY.sql and PreAggMONTH.sql, before any generator: MonthOfAnyYear becomes the one month 0 `Whole Year` of 365 days; ZoneMonthHour the MonthWeighting mean (source type 62, the HIGHEST selected ID); MonthGroupHour and e10FuelProperties the MonthGroupWeighting mean (source type 21, `SourceTypeOrdering`'s first); FuelSupply `sum(marketShare x actFract)` -- NOT a mean, so four months carry 0.334 of the year's gasoline, diesel and CNG; TotalIdleFraction `sum(totalIdleFraction x monthVMTFraction)` by source type, not a mean either; MonthVMTFraction, DayVMTFraction, StartsMonthAdjust and HotellingMonthAdjust constant 1. Measured in pandas against the execution database before the port (PLAN.md §7.3.65): ZoneMonthHour exact, MonthGroupHour 1.2e-16 (3.5e-08 with the FLOAT intermediate), FuelSupply exact from the default database's own rows, e10FuelProperties 1.4e-16, TotalIdleFraction 30 of 30 at 1.4e-08.\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1, the one fact no execution-database table records; `db_aggregationmonth` is the RunSpec's months, read from its XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py`, because MOVES overwrites the month list with month 0 after the collapse. `n_outputRate` is bound to 18071, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs of the one (county, month, day) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "year-aggregation",
      "brake-wear",
      "tire-wear",
      "crankcase"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
