        ],
        "note": "THE DAY TYPES THE RUNSPEC SELECTED, dayIDs 2 and 5, read out of the RunSpec XML by `tools/runspec-day-selection.py` into `runspecs/selections/scale-county-timeagg-year-rateday.parquet`: MOVES overwrites `RunSpecDay` with the synthesized day 0 AFTER the pre-aggregation has run (conventions §66.4). The execution database's tables were cut to these days before PreAggMONTH.sql collapsed them, so every collapse sums over them -- startsPerDay's `dayID/7`, startsOpModeDistribution's `dayID x startsPerDayPerVehicle`, the DayWeighting means.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
